# ::tok The index is based on several parameters examined in each authority, which examine the authority's level of "friendliness" to businesses located within its boundaries.
# ::node	i	index	1-2
# ::node	b	base-02	3-4
# ::node	s	several	5-6
# ::node	p	parameter	6-7
# ::node	e2	examine-01	7-8
